   "text": "pinch → move a window · second pinch → resize · flick up / down → maximize / minimize · hold at screen edge → next workspace\npoint, tap thumb → click / drag · thumb + pinky → pie menu · fist → close · two fingers → scroll · claw → volume / brightness\nfist to chin → window switcher · Y sign → dictate · \"I love you\" → spell an app's name · palm swipe → Enter · two claps → new tab",
   "originalText": "pinch → move a window · second pinch → resize · flick up / down → maximize / minimize · hold at screen edge → next workspace\npoint, tap thumb → click / drag · thumb + pinky → pie menu · fist → close · two fingers → scroll · claw → volume / brightness\nfist to chin → window switcher · Y sign → dictate · \"I love you\" → spell an app's name · palm swipe → Enter · two claps → new tab",
